Mixer for Tailsitter with x motor configuration and elevons
===========================================================

This file defines a single mixer for tailsitter with motors in X configuration.  All controls
are mixed 100%.

R: 4x

# left elevon
M: 2
S: 1 0   -10000   -10000      0  -10000  10000
S: 1 1   -10000   -10000      0  -10000  10000

# right elevon
M: 2
S: 1 0   -10000   -10000      0  -10000  10000
S: 1 1    10000   10000       0  -10000  10000

# left t-prop
M: 3
S: 6 2   -10000     -10000    0       -10000  10000
S: 6 0    10000      10000     0      -10000  10000
S: 6 3       0     10000  -10000      -10000  10000

# right t-prop
M: 3
S: 6 2    10000     10000     0      -10000  10000
S: 6 0   -10000    -10000     0      -10000  10000
S: 6 3       0     10000  -10000     -10000  10000
